Package: trackrideviz
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ffmpeg
Description: Race Track Visualizer - telemetry overlays for action camera video.
 Puts speed, lap times, G-force, track map, heart rate, power and other
 gauges from GPS and datalogger files on top of video and exports the result.
